#: data/maps/GraniteCave_StevensRoom/scripts.inc:82
msgctxt "GraniteCave_StevensRoom_Text_ImStevenLetterForMe"
msgid ""
"My name is STEVEN.\p"
"I'm interested in rare stones,\n"
"so I travel here and there.\p"
"Oh?\n"
"A LETTER for me?$"
msgstr ""
"我叫大吾。\p"
"我对稀有的石头很感兴趣，\n"
"所以到处旅行。\p"
"哦？\n"
"有给我的信？$"

#: data/maps/GraniteCave_StevensRoom/scripts.inc:89
msgctxt "GraniteCave_StevensRoom_Text_ThankYouTakeThis"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: Okay, thank you.\p"
"You went through all this trouble to\n"
"deliver that. I need to thank you.\p"
"Let me see…\n"
"I'll give you this TM.\p"
"It contains my favorite move,\n"
"STEEL WING.$"
msgstr ""
"大吾：好的，谢谢你。\p"
"你费了这么大的工夫\n"
"把信送过来，我得好好谢谢你。\p"
"我想想……\n"
"这个招式学习器就送给你吧。\p"
"里面是我最喜欢的招式，\n"
"钢翼。$"

#: data/maps/GraniteCave_StevensRoom/scripts.inc:98
msgctxt "GraniteCave_StevensRoom_Text_CouldBecomeChampionLetsRegister"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: Your POKéMON appear quite\n"
"capable.\p"
"If you keep training, you could even\n"
"become the CHAMPION of the POKéMON\l"
"LEAGUE one day. That's what I think.\p"
"I know, since we've gotten to know each\n"
"other, let's register one another in\l"
"our POKéNAVS.\p"
"… … … … … …$"
msgstr ""
"大吾：你的宝可梦\n"
"看起来很有实力。\p"
"只要继续努力训练，\n"
"说不定有一天你还能成为\l"
"宝可梦联盟的冠军。我是这么想的。\p"
"对了，既然我们认识了，\n"
"就在宝可梦导航里\l"
"互相登记一下吧。\p"
"…… …… ……$"

#: data/maps/GraniteCave_StevensRoom/scripts.inc:109
msgctxt "GraniteCave_StevensRoom_Text_RegisteredSteven"
msgid ""
"Registered STEVEN\n"
"in the POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""
"在宝可梦导航中\n"
"登记了大吾。$"

#: data/maps/GraniteCave_StevensRoom/scripts.inc:113
msgctxt "GraniteCave_StevensRoom_Text_IveGotToHurryAlong"
msgid "Now, I've got to hurry along.$"
msgstr "好了，我得赶路了。$"

#: data/maps/GraniteCave_StevensRoom/scripts.inc:116
msgctxt "GraniteCave_StevensRoom_Text_OhBagIsFull"
msgid ""
"Oh, your BAG is full…\n"
"That's too bad, then.$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，你的包包满了……\n"
"那真是可惜。$"
